BY PLACING AN ORDER, YOU ACKNOWLEDGE THAT YOU HAVE READ, UNDERSTOOD, AND AGREE TO THESE TERMS & CONDITIONS.', 'https://irsurnyfjgjmlhlrkbeh.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/1770223189361_95cinem.jpg', 'Divinely Threaded Scriptures', '["HOPEHOODIES","TESTAMENTSHIRTS","HUMILITYHATS","TRIUMPHTRACKS","PATIENCEPOLOS","SAINTYSWEATSHIRTS"]', '🎉 New Year Sale! Free Shipping on Orders Over £50 | Use Code: NEWYEAR2026', 'true', 'support@jamboapparels.com', 'false', null, 'Jambo Apparels | Premium Christian Streetwear & Scripture Clothing', 'Discover Jambo Apparels: Ethically threaded Christian streetwear designed for boldness. Shop premium hoodies, tees, and accessories that speak your testimony.', 'Shop Christian Clothing | Scripture Hoodies, Tees & Faith Apparel', 'Explore our full collection of faith-based fashion. From "Hope" hoodies to "Testament" tees, find high-quality apparel that helps you wear your faith boldly.', 'Faith Journal | Christian Lifestyle, Style Guides & Testimonies', 'Read stories of faith, customer testimonies, and style guides on how to wear scripture apparel in the modern world. Join the Jambo community discussion.', 'Our Mission & Story | The Heart Behind Jambo Apparels', 'Learn about our commitment to Honesty, Excellence, and Boldness. Discover how we are spreading the Gospel through ethically crafted Christian streetwear.', 'true', 'true', 'true', 'true', 'Linah Makembu', 'Linah Makembu is the Founding Director of Jambo Apparels, a faith-driven apparel brand created to glorify God through creativity, service, and purpose. Her journey began in 2019 through grassroots service in a local church, where she developed a heart for ministry, humility, and bold obedience. These values remain at the core of Jambo Apparels today.

With a strong passion for advocacy and community, Linah envisions Jambo Apparels as more than clothing. It is a platform for spreading the gospel to the ends of the earth, using uniquely threaded wear to communicate truth, faith, and identity in Christ.', 'https://irsurnyfjgjmlhlrkbeh.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/1770223319115_zhcg92u.png', 'Guided by honesty, excellence, and boldness, I lead Jambo Apparels with a commitment to honouring God in the work entrusted to us.', 'https://irsurnyfjgjmlhlrkbeh.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/1769244779306_q5udckq.png', 'false', 'false', 'false', 'false', 'AfVsjOsJNCcgKNns03cv7pK_WR3WiikShjXt3PxFtYlQvx6R2up6AdFtTV38TVL8uZEkoJMK_cTTBVe0', 'sandbox', 'true', 'true', 'true', 'EHNhUT4qsbKoazm8XFm7cyxD4UpFpDw7CI4ds4xYcUOo0pDVtL8KWRTorGASCi90GkFDIyDDnhpwCNkG', 'G-26S55GN10D', '<!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->
